OL,3,GNEWSAWildfowl deaths prompt fishing
OL,4,Atackle warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglers are being urged to "fish
OL,7,Fresponsibly" to protect wildlife after
OL,8,Fgeese and swans were killed by
OL,9,Fdiscarded tackle.
OL,11,FCornwall Council said abandoned lines,
OL,12,Fhooks and lures had been linked to 15
OL,13,Fcases of wildfowl injury and three
OL,14,Fdeaths over the past few months at St
OL,15,FAndrew's Wetland Nature Reserve in Par,
OL,16,FCornwall.
OL,18,FIt said one Canada goose was found in
OL,19,Fdistress with a lure and attached line
OL,20,Fwrapped around its legs and later died.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
