OL,3,GNEWSAWildfowl deaths prompt fishing
OL,4,Atackle warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FLoic Rich, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fenvironment on Cornwall Council, said
OL,8,Fthe birds had been through some "quite
OL,9,Fhorrific experiences, experiencing a
OL,10,Flot of pain and suffering" and warned
OL,11,Fthat if things did not change they
OL,12,Fwould ban fishing at the site.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
